{"3804930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Burger Shift: Team Rush","steam_appid":3804930,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4882060],"detailed_description":"<h1>DISCORD COMMUNITY<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/ac1ad4b03fb28f5f88a93718c64485b4.avif?t=1791296216\" width=616 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in solo or team up with up to 8 players in co-op. Host your own session or join others through the in-game lobby, using built-in voice and text chat to stay connected as you take on the rush. <br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.poster.avif?t=1791296216\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.webm?t=1791296216\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.mp4?t=1791296216\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run every part of a bustling fast food kitchen, from operating fryers and soda fountains to flipping burgers on the grill. Learn the ins and outs of each station to keep things running smoothly.  <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.poster.avif?t=1791296216\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.webm?t=1791296216\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.mp4?t=1791296216\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected: chaotic events, strange customers, and surprise challenges demand quick thinking and solid teamwork. Communication and coordination are your tools for success. <br>    <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.poster.avif?t=1791296216\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.webm?t=1791296216\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.mp4?t=1791296216\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp and manage your time wisely. Keep orders flowing and customers happy by assigning roles, juggling priorities, and working as one unstoppable crew. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.poster.avif?t=1791296216\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.webm?t=1791296216\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3804930\/extras\/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.mp4?t=1791296216\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","ab